# W5 acceptance row 4, part 3: Art-Net input. Hardware Setup switches the DMX-in source to Art-Net (the universe box is
# then the Port-Address, 10); `w5_wire.py send artnet 10 0:2=150,14=255 9000:stop` (ch 14 = the Master Intensity function part 1 assigned) sends ArtDmx from 127.0.0.2 to
# 127.0.0.1:6454, where the Art-Net socket opens for the input. Output 1:1 takes DMX-in 2 (HTP).
open hardware_setup
click THardwareSetupForm2.cbDmxInSource
key Down
key Enter
assert_text THardwareSetupForm2.cbDmxInSource "Art-Net"
click THardwareSetupForm2.bOk
assert_file_line Hardware.Ini "In=10"
click main.tb_cuelist_10
wait 2000
assert_text TDmxInForm.lChIn "DMX Channels In 512"
assert_frame 1:1=150
shot ../w5shots/dmxin-artnet.png
quit
